We are looking for a passionate, hardworking team player, who thrives in a fast-paced environment and is eager to learn and get stuck into solving hard problems. Key capabilities and experience include:
At least 3 years’ work experience, newly qualified CA or equivalent;
A strong technical background including knowledge of NZ IFRS or US GAAP (or both);
Experience dealing with multinational enterprises and consolidations;
Experience with auditing processes.
Why this role matters
Halter is growing fast, expanding into new markets, and our finance function needs to scale alongside it to ensure we can maintain speed, without compromising on quality of output or the trust of our stakeholders.

This role sits at the centre of how we account for a business spanning multiple jurisdictions and the complexities of managing varying currencies, tax regimes and accounting frameworks. You’ll have a direct impact on building the processes, controls and judgments that underpin Halter’s next phase of growth.

